{#
  The evaluator catalogue, guardrail lifecycle, and reviewer actions.

  Evaluator status follows the roadmap tasks in step 2.2 rather than a separate
  judgement. Five evaluators run as structured LLM calls inside LangGraph;
  Chrono is a local estimator and makes no model call at all. None of them
  approves anything.
#}
